%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-math-functions-log10 (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::util::Math
output application/json
---
{
  "log1010": log10(10),
  "log1013": log10(0.13),
  "log10-20": log10(-20)
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "log1010": 1,
  "log1013": -0.8860566476931632,
  "log10-20": null
}
